# Runtime artifacts generated by running the app or the test suite.
# The tracked *.db files in this repo are seed state — running the
# thesaurus/learning engines rewrites and grows them (moby_thesaurus.db
# more than doubles on first population), so their working-tree churn
# must not be committed. These two are created fresh at runtime and were
# never meant to be tracked at all.
prosodic_labels.db
infrastructure/prosodic_errors.log
